ui-don-t-use-icons-and-labels-on-only-some-tabs-keep-the-treatment-consistent-across-the-set = Don't use icons and labels on only some tabs; keep the treatment consistent across the set

ui-labels-should-clearly-and-succinctly-describe-the-content-of-a-tab-and-fit-on-a-single-row = Labels should clearly and succinctly describe the content of a tab and fit on a single row. A label can use a second line with truncated text, or the set can switch to scrollable tabs to fit longer titles.

ui-tab-labels-should-be-short-and-succinct-there-should-be-a-clear-relationship-to-the-title = Tab labels should be short and succinct. There should be a clear relationship to the title above.

ui-scrollable-tabs-offset-the-first-tab-52dp-from-the-leading-edge-and-the-width-of-each-tab = Scrollable tabs offset the first tab 52dp from the leading edge, and the width of each tab is set by its label. Avoid inconsistent padding between tabs.

